flowchart TB
accTitle: Quarantine spans detection, cleanup and the approval wait
accDescr: A user starts with a protected explicit-deny boundary. Event detection starts cleanup and security notification, then a recorded approval is the only path to approved permissions. Rejection or failure retains denial.
U[Create user<br/>Protected explicit deny already applied]:::inputData --> E[EventBridge starts workflow<br/>Verify quarantine and clean permissions]:::process
E --> N[Notify security<br/>Wait for authenticated decision]:::process
N --> A{Approval recorded?}:::decision
A -->|Yes| P[Authorized release<br/>Only approved permissions]:::output
A -->|Rejected, timeout or failure| Q[Keep explicit-deny quarantine]:::warning
